WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.981
Kusheh en welkom to SaloneHCM — na Salone yon platform for manage workman den en pay salary.

2
00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:16.882
Insai dis first lesson, wi go sign in for di first time, waka round di dashboard, learn usai everything de, en show yu aw for find all di feature dem wey yu get. Mek wi start.

3
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:22.615
Dis na di sign-in page. Put di work email en password wey yu administrator don gi yu.

4
00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:30.252
If yu organisation don turn on two-factor authentication, den go ask yu for one six digit code from yu authenticator app.

5
00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:33.282
Now watch as wi sign in as system administrator.

6
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.156
En dis na yu dashboard — di heart of SaloneHCM.

7
00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:47.183
Na di top yu go see live numbers: aw much workman den de, aw much di monthly payroll de cost, leave request dem wey de wait, en compliance status.

8
00:00:47.183 --> 00:00:50.274
Everything de update real time as yu team de work.

9
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.819
Na di left side na di navigation sidebar.

10
00:00:53.819 --> 00:01:01.026
E de show only di module dem wey yu role en yu organisation plan don unlock — so wetin yu see na wetin yu able use.

11
00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:05.914
Core H R de na top, payroll en finance de follow am, den administration tools.

12
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.730
Yu no sure usai something de? Open di Feature Directory.

13
00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:21.916
All di module dem insai di platform de list ya, group by wetin den de do, with simple explanation en live status — available, need bigger plan, or na only administrator able go de.

14
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:24.650
Click any available card for jump go direct.

15
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:40.948
Last thing, memba two things: yu settings page na usai yu change yu password en two-factor security, en di Training Center — usai yu find dis video — get quick reference card, knowledge base article, en certification quiz for every role.

16
00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:42.498
Yu ready for explore now.
